      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007.pdf, p.5",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Each provision of this Act specified in column 1 of the table\ncommences, or is taken to have commenced, in accordance with\ncolumn 2 of the table. Any other statement in column 2 has effect\naccording to its terms.\n\nCommencement information\nColumn 1\nColumn 2\nColumn 3\nProvision(s)\nCommencement\nDate/Details",
