      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00383\n\nConsequential amendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nAustralian Citizenship (Transitionals and Consequentials) Act 2007\nCompilation date: 1/7/15\nRegistered: 10/8/15",
      "skos:definition": "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00383\n\nConsequential amendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nAustralian Citizenship (Transitionals and Consequentials) Act 2007\nCompilation date: 1/7/15\nRegistered: 10/8/15",
      "cml:asserts": [
