    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007-sch-1-sec-2-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2 Exempt citizenship documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007#sch-1-sec-2-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Section 11 does not apply to a document required or permitted to\nbe produced in connection with:\n\n(a) ascertaining whether a person is, or remains, an Australian\ncitizen; or\n\n(b) the operation of a provision of a citizenship law that relates\nto:\n\n(i) registration; or\n\n(ii) an application for, or the giving of, an approval to\nbecome an Australian citizen; or\n\n(iii) an application for, or the giving of, a notice about\nevidence of Australian citizenship; or\n\n(iv) the cancellation or surrender of a notice about evidence\nof Australian citizenship; or\n\n(v) the renunciation of Australian citizenship; or\n\n(vi) the revocation of Australian citizenship; or\n\n(c) the operation of a provision of a citizenship law that relates\nto:\n\n(i) the keeping of a register; or\n\n(ii) the correction of an entry in a register; or\n\n(iii) the cancellation of an entry in a register.\n\n(2) In this clause:\ncitizenship law means:\n\n(a) the Australian Citizenship Act 2007; or\n\n(b) regulations under that Act.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00383\n\nSchedule 1  Consequential amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Section 11 does not apply to a document required or permitted to\nbe produced in connection with:\n\n(a) ascertaining whether a person is, or remains, an Australian\ncitizen; or\n\n(b) the operation of a provision of a citizenship law that relates\nto:\n\n(i) registration; or\n\n(ii) an application for, or the giving of, an approval to\nbecome an Australian citizen; or\n\n(iii) an application for, or the giving of, a notice about\nevidence of Australian citizenship; or\n\n(iv) the cancellation or surrender of a notice about evidence\nof Australian citizenship; or\n\n(v) the renunciation of Australian citizenship; or\n\n(vi) the revocation of Australian citizenship; or\n\n(c) the operation of a provision of a citizenship law that relates\nto:\n\n(i) the keeping of a register; or\n\n(ii) the correction of an entry in a register; or\n\n(iii) the cancellation of an entry in a register.\n\n(2) In this clause:\ncitizenship law means:\n\n(a) the Australian Citizenship Act 2007; or\n\n(b) regulations under that Act.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00383\n\nSchedule 1  Consequential amendments",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007-sch-1-sec-2-2-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007-sch-1-sec-2-2-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ab8a56214a226d3f5ca2dd2c457904bc9b95500f0db1845af730aed0140bc3e4"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007#sch-1-sec-2-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2 Exempt citizenship documents",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 11,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Section 11 does not apply to a document required or permitted to\nbe produced in connection with:\n\n(a) ascertaining whether a person is, or remains, an Australian\ncitizen; or\n\n(b) the operation of a provision of a citizenship law that relates\nto:\n\n(i) registration; or\n\n(ii) an application for, or the giving of, an approval to\nbecome an Australian citizen; or\n\n(iii) an application for, or the giving of, a notice about\nevidence of Australian citizenship; or\n\n(iv) the cancellation or surrender of a notice about evidence\nof Australian citizenship; or\n\n(v) the renunciation of Australian citizenship; or\n\n(vi) the revocation of Australian citizenship; or\n\n(c) the operation of a provision of a citizenship law that relates\nto:\n\n(i) the keeping of a register; or\n\n(ii) the correction of an entry in a register; or\n\n(iii) the cancellation of an entry in a register.\n\n(2) In this clause:\ncitizenship law means:\n\n(a) the Australian Citizenship Act 2007; or\n\n(b) regulations under that Act.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00383\n\nSchedule 1  Consequential amendments"
    },
