      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40 Subsection 7(7) (definition of Australian citizen)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 13,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the definition, substitute:\nAustralian citizen has the same meaning as in the Australian\nCitizenship Act 2007.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00383\n\nSchedule 1  Consequential amendments"
    },
