      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(b) service in the Naval Reserve, the Army Reserve or Air Force\nReserve includes service in any reserve force that is a\npredecessor (whether immediate or otherwise) of the Naval\nReserve, the Army Reserve or Air Force Reserve.",
      "skos:definition": "(b) service in the Naval Reserve, the Army Reserve or Air Force\nReserve includes service in any reserve force that is a\npredecessor (whether immediate or otherwise) of the Naval\nReserve, the Army Reserve or Air Force Reserve.",
