      "cml:premiseText": "Minister must not take into account...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...certain periods"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007-sch-3-sec-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6 Revocation of citizenship by conferral under the new Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007#sch-3-sec-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007.pdf, p.21",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies to a person who, under subitem 2(2) of this Part, is\ntaken, on and from the commencement day, to be an Australian citizen\nunder Subdivision B of Division 2 of Part 2 of the new Act.\nFalse or misleading statement in application\n(2)\nSubparagraph 34(2)(b)(i) of the new Act applies as if it also referred to\nthe person’s conviction, at any time, of an offence against section 50 of\nthe old Act in relation to the person’s application for the certificate of\nAustralian citizenship made under the old Act.\nConviction of serious offence\n(3)\nSubparagraph 34(2)(b)(ii) of the new Act applies as if it also referred to\nthe person’s conviction, at any time after the person made the\napplication for the certificate of Australian citizenship under the old\nAct, of an offence referred to in subparagraph 21(1)(a)(ii) of the old Act\nthat the person committed at any time before the grant of the certificate.\nMigration-related fraud\n(4)\nSubparagraph 34(2)(b)(iii) of the new Act applies as if it also referred to\nthe person obtaining the certificate of Australian citizenship under the\nold Act as a result of migration-related fraud within the meaning of\nsubsections 21(1A) and (1B) of the old Act.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00383\n\nSchedule 3  Application and transitional provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThis item applies to a person who, under subitem 2(2) of this Part, is\ntaken, on and from the commencement day, to be an Australian citizen\nunder Subdivision B of Division 2 of Part 2 of the new Act.\nFalse or misleading statement in application\n(2)\nSubparagraph 34(2)(b)(i) of the new Act applies as if it also referred to\nthe person’s conviction, at any time, of an offence against section 50 of\nthe old Act in relation to the person’s application for the certificate of\nAustralian citizenship made under the old Act.\nConviction of serious offence\n(3)\nSubparagraph 34(2)(b)(ii) of the new Act applies as if it also referred to\nthe person’s conviction, at any time after the person made the\napplication for the certificate of Australian citizenship under the old\nAct, of an offence referred to in subparagraph 21(1)(a)(ii) of the old Act\nthat the person committed at any time before the grant of the certificate.\nMigration-related fraud\n(4)\nSubparagraph 34(2)(b)(iii) of the new Act applies as if it also referred to\nthe person obtaining the certificate of Australian citizenship under the\nold Act as a result of migration-related fraud within the meaning of\nsubsections 21(1A) and (1B) of the old Act.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00383\n\nSchedule 3  Application and transitional provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007-sch-3-sec-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007-sch-3-sec-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fa0707a125f6e9df51ca38dbcf6cfd98b688e1641d052dfe1fbda11bf7f386a1",
      "skos:note": "Revocation of citizenship by conferral under the new Act"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007#sch-3-sec-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 Revocation of citizenship by conferral under the new Act",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 21,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies to a person who, under subitem 2(2) of this Part, is\ntaken, on and from the commencement day, to be an Australian citizen\nunder Subdivision B of Division 2 of Part 2 of the new Act.\nFalse or misleading statement in application\n(2)\nSubparagraph 34(2)(b)(i) of the new Act applies as if it also referred to\nthe person’s conviction, at any time, of an offence against section 50 of\nthe old Act in relation to the person’s application for the certificate of\nAustralian citizenship made under the old Act.\nConviction of serious offence\n(3)\nSubparagraph 34(2)(b)(ii) of the new Act applies as if it also referred to\nthe person’s conviction, at any time after the person made the\napplication for the certificate of Australian citizenship under the old\nAct, of an offence referred to in subparagraph 21(1)(a)(ii) of the old Act\nthat the person committed at any time before the grant of the certificate.\nMigration-related fraud\n(4)\nSubparagraph 34(2)(b)(iii) of the new Act applies as if it also referred to\nthe person obtaining the certificate of Australian citizenship under the\nold Act as a result of migration-related fraud within the meaning of\nsubsections 21(1A) and (1B) of the old Act.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015C00383\n\nSchedule 3  Application and transitional provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007-sch-3-sec-6-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007-sch-3-sec-6"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
