      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-transitionals-and-consequentials-act-2007.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by items 15 and 16 of Schedule 1 apply in\nrelation to nominations made on or after the commencement day.",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments made by items 15 and 16 of Schedule 1 apply in\nrelation to nominations made on or after the commencement day.",
      "cml:asserts": [
